(text "08 | LED gate drive and hardware inhibit" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df5f8b81-adad-514d-82e8-80b3072f93e1"))
(text "BLOCK_OC is wired OR: L7987 PGOOD + LM2903 output, pulled up only to +3V3.\nBAT54 anode -> nDIM; cathode -> BLOCK_OC. Do not reverse this diode.\nOne shared 10k pull-down on nDIM defeats BOTH internal LM3429 hysteresis sources after MCU reset.\nDo NOT add a 100n capacitor to nDIM. GPIO25 HIGH is enabled only after software checks.\nUVLO nominal release 19.90 V / fall 19.70 V depends on +3V3 reference and comparator tolerances.\nTC4427A is dual non-inverting. 1k inputs + 100k pulls; 4R7 output resistors drive IRF540Z gates.\nPower sequencing, BAT54 cold Vf / hot leakage and nDIM reset levels remain hardware tests.\nUnused comparator inputs tied to valid DC levels; its unused open-collector output is NC." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "74dbc2ca-a2a6-5f64-afa9-1286d3421cf5"))
